 class=\"gh-hero__sunburst\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></div><div class=\"gh-hero__inner\"><h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"gh-hero__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Sara + Tyler</span></h1><p class=\"gh-hero__date\"><time datetime=\"2027-07-17\" class=\"gh-numeral gh-hero__motif\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">07 · 17 · 27</span></time><span class=\"gh-hero__long\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027</span></span></p><p class=\"gh-hero__place\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago</span></p><p class=\"gh-hero__status\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are getting married</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></p><p class=\"gh-hero__lede\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are inviting the people we love into the places, adventures, and memories that made us. Details as they are settled.</span></span></p><div class=\"gh-hero__countdown-slot\"><p class=\"gh-countdown\"><span class=\"gh-countdown__num\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">297</span></span><span class=\"gh-countdown__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">days</span><!-- --> <!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">to go</span></span></p></div><div class=\"gh-hero__actions\"><a class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--primary\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span></a><a class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--ghost\" href=\"/explore-caa\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Explore the building</span></span></a></div><p class=\"gh-hero__note\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Many of you will be travelling in: rooms, airports, and getting around will appear here as we confirm them.</span></span></p></div></section><section id=\"adventures\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"adventures-title\" data-number=\"1\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Our adventures\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">01</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Part </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">1</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Adventure</span></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"adventures-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our adventures</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Museum of Ice Cream. Richardson Farm. Michael Jordan's Steakhouse. Food tastings, gardening together, the Madison waterfront, and Starved Rock, where the first “I love you” happened. </span></span><span class=\"todo\" role=\"note\" data-placeholder=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span class=\"todo__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">:</span></span> <!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">which adventures are public, with our photos</span></span></p></div><p class=\"gh-section__action\"><a class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--secondary\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our Adventures</span></span></a></p></div></section><section id=\"the-building\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--alt\" aria-labelledby=\"the-building-title\" data-number=\"2\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"The building\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">02</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Part </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Place</span></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"the-building-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The building</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Built in 1893 for the private Chicago Athletic Association: Henry Ives Cobb’s Venetian Gothic after the Doge’s Palace, opened amid the World’s Columbian Exposition, a club until 2007, restored as a hotel. Patterned brick, carved limestone, stained glass, marble floors, and Millennium Park out the windows.</span></span></p></div><dl class=\"gh-stats\"><div class=\"gh-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"gh-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Date</span></dt><dd class=\"gh-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027</span></dd></div><div class=\"gh-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"gh-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Venue</span></dt><dd class=\"gh-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span></dd></div><div class=\"gh-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"gh-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Address</span></dt><dd class=\"gh-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60603</span></dd></div></dl><div class=\"gh-map\" data-bl-s=\"\"><p class=\"gh-map__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span></p><p class=\"gh-map__address\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60603</span></p><a class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--external\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=12%20S%20Michigan%20Ave%2C%20Chicago%2C%20IL%2060603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-bl-s=\"\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Open in </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Google Maps</span></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"gh-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">, opens Google Maps</span></span></a><p class=\"gh-map__url\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=12%20S%20Michigan%20Ave%2C%20Chicago%2C%20IL%2060603</span></p></div><p class=\"gh-section__action\"><a class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--secondary\" href=\"/explore-caa\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore CAA</span></span></a></p></div></section><section id=\"our-story\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"our-story-title\" data-number=\"3\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"How we met\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">03</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Part </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">3</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Memory</span></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"our-story-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How we met</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">At Allison and Jamie’s wedding: flirty glances, and a connection that was immediate. </span></span><span class=\"todo\" role=\"note\" data-placeholder=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span class=\"todo__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">:</span></span> <!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the rest of the story, in our words</span></span></p></div><p class=\"gh-section__action\"><a class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--secondary\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our Story</span></span></a></p></div></section></main><nav class=\"gh-panel\" aria-label=\"Quick actions\" style=\"--cells:4\"><a class=\"gh-panel__cell\" href=\"/our-story\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-